  "details": "When browsing the Worlds menu, it’s very easy to accidentally join a world while scrolling. This often happens when a small input mistake triggers the join action unintentionally.\n\nI’d like to request an optional confirmation prompt before joining a world from the Worlds menu, especially when scrolling through the list. This could be a simple “Are you sure you want to join this world?”",
